{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "提问": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Question"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回答": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bark 通知": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bark notifications"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bark 推送地址": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bark push URL"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bark 服务器": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bark server"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从 Bark 首页复制推送地址并粘贴到这里，例如 https://api.day.app/设备密钥。地址只保存在执行主机上，保存后不再显示设备密钥。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy the HTTPS push URL from Bark and paste it here, for example https://api.day.app/device-key. It is stored only on the execution host. The device key is not shown after saving."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "任务已保存，但通知设置未保存。请重试或重新打开任务确认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The task was saved, but its notification setting was not. Retry or reopen the task to confirm."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任务已保存，但通知设置未保存。请重试或重新打开任务确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "任务所在主机": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Execution host"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存失败，请检查主机连接，并粘贴 Bark 首页完整的 HTTPS 推送地址。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not save. Check the host connection and paste the full HTTPS push URL from Bark."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存推送地址": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save push URL"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发送 Bark 测试通知": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send Bark test notification"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已保存，请发送测试通知并检查手机。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved. Send a test notification and check your phone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已移除 Bark 配置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bark configuration removed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手机安装 Bark 后可接收会话完成和计划任务结果通知，无需配置 APNs 密钥。请在各执行主机分别配置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install Bark on your phone to receive conversation completion and scheduled task results without APNs credentials. Configure each execution host separately."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法读取 Bark 设置，请确认主机已连接并安装最新推送插件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cannot read Bark settings. Check that the host is connected and has the latest push plugin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法读取通知设置。请确认任务所在主机已安装并启用最新推送插件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unable to read notification settings. Install and enable the latest push plugin on the execution host."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取通知设置。请确认任务所在主机已安装并启用最新推送插件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最近一次请求失败，请检查地址和主机网络": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The last request failed. Check the URL and host network."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最近一次请求已被 Bark 接受": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The last request was accepted by Bark"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在等待主机连接…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waiting for the host to connect…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待主机连接…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每次运行结束后，向手机通知结果或失败原因；自动归档不影响通知。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notify your phone of the result or failure after each run, even when it is automatically archived."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次运行结束后，向手机通知结果或失败原因；自动归档不影响通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "测试发送失败，请检查 Bark 地址和主机网络后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not send the test. Check the Bark URL and host network, then retry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "测试请求已被 Bark 接受，请检查手机锁屏通知。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bark accepted the test request. Check your phone for a Lock Screen notification."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "移除 Bark 配置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove Bark configuration"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "移除失败，请检查主机连接后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not remove the configuration. Check the host connection and retry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "计划任务已删除或不存在。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This scheduled task has been deleted or no longer exists."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "计划任务已删除或不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请允许 Bark 的锁屏通知。测试收到后，在计划任务中开启“通知任务结果”并保存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow Lock Screen notifications for Bark. After receiving the test, enable Notify task results in your scheduled task and save."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先在任务所在主机配置手机推送，并在手机上开启通知。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set up push notifications on the execution host and enable notifications on your phone first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先在任务所在主机配置手机推送，并在手机上开启通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先配置 Bark 推送，或配置 APNs 并在手机上开启通知。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure Bark, or configure APNs and enable notifications on your phone first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请连接会话或任务所在主机，并在该主机安装和启用最新的推送插件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect to the host running the conversation or task and install and enable the latest push plugin there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通知任务结果": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notify task results"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知任务结果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "配置 Bark 推送…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure Bark…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已开启的通知会将会话标题与回复摘要，或任务名称与结果摘要发送到所填的 Bark 服务器。点击通知可打开 Paseo 的对应会话或任务记录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enabled notifications send conversation titles and reply previews, or task names and result summaries, to the specified Bark server. Tap a notification to open the corresponding conversation or task history in Paseo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重新检查通知设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check notification settings again"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新检查通知设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已配置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configured"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通知所在主机": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notification host"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会话完成通知": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conversation completion notifications"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "普通会话每次回复完成后推送到手机，点击可打开对应会话。Mac 正在使用时也会推送，Mac 系统通知照常保留。计划任务仍使用各任务的“通知任务结果”开关。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Push each completed conversation reply to your phone. Tap to open the conversation. Notifications also arrive while the Mac is active; Mac system notifications remain enabled. Scheduled tasks use their own Notify task results switch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会话通知设置保存失败，请检查主机连接后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not save conversation notification settings. Check the host connection and retry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
