    "App 不在前台时也更新 iPhone 灵动岛和锁屏；装一台就够，装完在设置 → 通知里配置 APNs 密钥": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps the iPhone Dynamic Island and Lock Screen updated when the app is in the background. One host is enough; after installing, configure the APNs key in Settings → Notifications."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 不在前台时，由推送机器经 Apple 推送更新灵动岛和锁屏，它会把已关联机器上的会话一起算进来。密钥在 Apple 开发者后台 → Keys 创建（勾选 Apple Push Notifications service，Key Restriction 选 Topic Specific → %@），Sandbox 和 Production 各建一个，只保存在那台机器上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When the app is in the background, the push host updates the Dynamic Island and Lock Screen through Apple push, counting sessions on all linked hosts. Create the key in the Apple Developer portal under Keys (enable Apple Push Notifications service, set Key Restriction to Topic Specific → %@). Create one each for Sandbox and Production; they are stored only on that host."
          }
        }
      }
    },
