              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "It will also be removed from %lld hosts."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会从 ~/.agents、~/.claude、~/.codex 移除所有 Paseo 编排 skills。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removes all Paseo orchestration skills from ~/.agents, ~/.claude, ~/.codex on this host."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会从这台机器上卸载这个插件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This plugin will be uninstalled from this host."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会停掉本 App 的 daemon、取消它的开机启动，再打开官方 Paseo App，由它用同一个 ~/.paseo 运行 daemon，机器 ID 和配对不变。%@本 App 装的命令行留着，以后可以再切回来。%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This stops this app’s daemon and removes it from login items, then opens the official Paseo app, which runs the daemon with the same ~/.paseo. The host ID and pairing stay the same. %@The command line installed by this app is kept, so you can switch back later. %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "会停掉本 App 的 daemon、取消它的开机启动，再打开官方 Paseo App，由它用同一个 ~/.paseo 运行 daemon，机器 ID 和配对不变。%1$@本 App 装的命令行留着，以后可以再切回来。%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会安装 Paseo 命令行 %@，约 1–2 分钟，然后开机自动运行 daemon，并把这台 Mac 加到机器列表。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This installs the Paseo command line %@ (about 1–2 minutes), runs the daemon automatically at login, and adds This Mac to the host list."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会安装官方的 Paseo 命令行（机器上没有 Node 20+ 时一并下载 Node），约 600 MB，用开机启动项保持运行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This installs the official Paseo command line (and downloads Node if the host doesn’t have Node 20+), about 600 MB, and keeps it running with a login item."
          }
        }
      }
    },
