    "命令行和 daemon 装在「应用程序支持/Paseo Native」里，~/.local/bin/paseo 指向它。更新只升级 daemon；官方客户端的新功能要等本 App 跟进。不要同时打开官方 App，它会再起一个 daemon 抢同一个 ~/.paseo；想换回去用「切回官方 App」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The CLI and daemon are installed in “Application Support/Paseo Native”, and ~/.local/bin/paseo points to it. Updates only upgrade the daemon; new features in the official client have to wait for this app to catch up. Don't open the official app at the same time — it would start another daemon competing for the same ~/.paseo. To switch back, use “Switch Back to Official App”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
