    },
    "在 %@ 上用那里登录的 Claude 或 Codex 账户预测，消耗该账户用量。「跟随会话」时 Codex 会话用 Codex、其他用 Claude，没装的那个会自动换成另一个。改动自动保存，从下一轮开始生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Predictions run on %@ using the Claude or Codex account signed in there, and count against that account's usage. With “Follow Session”, Codex sessions use Codex and others use Claude; if one isn't installed, the other is used automatically. Changes save automatically and take effect from the next turn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 %@ 上用那里登录的 Claude 账户预测，消耗该账户用量。改动自动保存，从下一轮开始生效。": {
