    "正在运行的会话会中断（开了「重启后恢复」的会接着做）；终端里的程序可以保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Running sessions will be interrupted (those with “Resume After Restart” on will pick up where they left off); programs in terminals are kept."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "stale"
    },
    "正在运行的会话会中断，终端也会被关闭。这台 daemon 升级到 0.15 后，重启可以保留终端。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Running sessions will be interrupted and terminals will be closed. After this daemon is upgraded to 0.15, restarting can keep terminals."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在运行的会话会中断，要手动继续（目前「重启后恢复」只对崩溃、断电生效）；终端里的程序可以保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Running sessions will be interrupted and need to be continued by hand (for now, resume after restart only works after a crash or power loss). Programs in terminals can keep running."
          }
        }
      }
    },
