    "每轮结束后用那台机器上的 Claude 预测你下一句可能要说的话，显示在空输入框里：Tab 或点一下填入，纸飞机直接发送。改动自动保存，从下一轮开始生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After each turn, Claude on that host predicts what you might say next and shows it in the empty input box: press Tab or click to fill it in, or click the paper plane to send it directly. Changes are saved automatically and take effect from the next turn."
