    "直连": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Direct Connection"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "直连不经过中继，也没有端到端加密，只适合本机或可信的局域网。daemon 默认只监听 127.0.0.1:6767，别的设备要连需要它监听局域网地址；用域名连还要在 daemon 里允许该主机名。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A direct connection doesn’t go through the relay and isn’t end-to-end encrypted; use it only on this Mac or a trusted local network. By default the daemon listens only on 127.0.0.1:6767; for other devices to connect, it must listen on a LAN address, and to connect by domain name you also need to allow that hostname in the daemon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
