    "请复制 Markdown 表格、网页表格或行列一致的制表符文本。原内容未改动，可使用普通粘贴。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy a Markdown table, a web table, or tab-separated text with consistent columns. Your content is unchanged; you can use regular paste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动检查更新会在启动、回到前台及运行期间查询 GitHub，自动检查至少间隔 30 分钟。只下载版本信息，不上传任何数据；有新版本时提示你下载，不会自动安装。\n遇到问题时导出，发给开发者分析。包含版本、各机器的连接、Provider 和插件状态、日志；不含对话内容，配对链接和密码会隐藏。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic update checks contact GitHub at launch, when returning to the foreground, and while running, at least 30 minutes apart. Only version info is downloaded and no data is uploaded. When a new version is available you’ll be prompted to download it; nothing is installed automatically.\nIf you run into problems, export diagnostics and send them to the developer. They include the version, each host’s connection, Provider and plugin status, and logs; they don’t include conversation content, and pairing links and passwords are hidden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "选择「以后再说」将在 24 小时后再次提醒；也可以随时到「设置 → 关于」下载。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose Later to be reminded after 24 hours. You can also download from Settings → About at any time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
